<aside class="properties"><p class="eyebrow">PAGE DETAILS</p><h2 id="properties-heading">Issue details</h2><div id="properties"></div><details class="handoff"><summary>Prepare for publication</summary><ul id="blockers"></ul><button id="handoff">Download handoff</button><p>This downloads a preparation file. It does not notify anyone or publish. Ahimanikya approves the final website release.</p></details></aside></div><noscript>This private editor requires JavaScript. No draft is submitted from this page.</noscript></body></html>
